<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>1920 x 1080 looting macro for back to back looting</Major>
    <Description>A simple looter macro that moves the first 6 loot items from bags or chests to your inventory. Unlike other macros, this one will move the loot to the bottom of your inventory. This avoids errors if you already have loot on your player.

Once you place on a hotkey, open a chest/bag and press the hotkey to activate the looting macro. The macro will do the following:

1. Scroll to the bottom of your inventory
2. Drag the first 6 items in the bag to your inventory

To continue looting other bags and chests after the first acivation. Simply press the 'Sort' button in your inventory window to make room for the next loot activation.</Description>
    <Comment>This macro works for 1920 x 1080  fullscreen and borderless PC versions of Albion. </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
